## 3. Tech Stack

| Layer | Tool | Role in the project |
|---|---|---|
| Storage / lakehouse | **Snowflake** | Stores raw pings, polygons, and marts. Uses the native `GEOGRAPHY` type. |
| Spatial processing | **Apache Sedona on PySpark** | Distributed spatial joins (for example, 10M pings against 5,000 store polygons) and trip building. |
| Data modeling | **dbt** | Cleans the joined data and builds hourly footfall metrics, with tests and documentation. |
| Visualization | **Kepler.gl + React** | Interactive 3D hexbins, animated trips, and movement arcs in a web app. |
| Supporting | Python, H3 | Synthetic data generation, spatial indexing, and orchestration scripts. |

